OL,3,GNEWSARedundant workers set up blue
OL,4,Aglass firm to keep heritage 'alive'
OL,5,
OL,6,FWorkers behind a historic glassmaker
OL,7,Fthat closed down due to rising costs
OL,8,Fhave announced they will open a new
OL,9,Fservice to help "keep the heritage" of
OL,10,Fglass blowing "alive".
OL,12,FBristol Blue Glass, which produced
OL,13,Fspecialist glassware for nearly four
OL,14,Fdecades, closed in May due to rising
OL,15,Fcosts and made its staff redundant.
OL,17,FThe new company, Bristol Glassworks
OL,18,FLtd, will make blue glass but also
OL,19,Fother colours with with what it called
OL,20,Fmodern designs.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,342,340,200,160,0,100
