OL,3,GNEWSARedundant workers set up blue
OL,4,Aglass firm to keep heritage 'alive'
OL,5,
OL,6,FGlassblower and codirector David Barry
OL,7,Fsaid after seeing the outpouring of
OL,8,Fsupport following the May closure, it
OL,9,Fwas a "no-brainer" to get up and
OL,10,Frunning again and that he "felt a sense
OL,11,Fof duty to bring blue glass back to
OL,12,FBristol".
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
